ie\",\"overview\":\"The Grand Budapest Hotel tells of a legendary concierge at a famous European hotel between the wars and his friendship with a young employee who becomes his trusted protégé. The story involves the theft and recovery of a priceless Renaissance painting, the battle for an enormous family fortune and the slow and then sudden upheavals that transformed Europe during the first half of the 20th century.\",\"genres\":[\"Comedy\",\"Drama\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":1088548,\"title\":\"Bitter Christmas\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/kiPGcHX0YT49nrab76G0bqw3gHW.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/ppLv2F7dhvI3wxaEoOP1E0OyBPP.jpg\",\"rating\":6.2,\"year\":2026,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"During a long December holiday weekend, a woman, whose mother has recently died, throws herself into work as a form of escape. Her relentless pace is interrupted when a panic attack forces her to take a break.\",\"genres\":[\"Drama\",\"Comedy\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":1325734,\"title\":\"The Drama\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/rnIOUhzwJDfgQakx8EjoNyItKgs.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/1oKLEA9JOhvaBwLpqjROisvWMy7.jpg\",\"rating\":6.9,\"year\":2026,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"A happily engaged couple is put to the test when an unexpected turn sends their wedding week off the rails.\",\"genres\":[\"Romance\",\"Comedy\",\"Drama\"],\"daysUntil\":null}],\"videos\":[{\"key\":\"VNw6Su_TeDA\",\"name\":\"Official Trailer\",\"site\":\"YouTube\",\"type\":\"Trailer\"}],\"daysUntil\":null}","status":200,"url":""},"revalidate":86400,"tags":[]}